{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06109","headline":"重酬苑郎中 · 王维","name":"重酬苑郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何幸含香奉至尊，多慙未报主人恩。\n草木尽能酬雨露，荣枯安敢问乾坤。\n仙郎有意怜同舍，丞相无私断埽门。\n扬子解嘲徒自遣，冯唐已老复何论。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06109.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06109","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}